<title>BANGLADESH: BOC Bangladesh yr to Sept 96 net 26.75 pct down.</title>
<headline>BOC Bangladesh yr to Sept 96 net 26.75 pct down.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended on September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in million taka unless stated).</p>
<p>			 1995/96	   1994/95</p>
<p>    Net profit	  59.4    vs     81.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit    83.5    vs    133.4</p>
<p>    Gross profit     239.5    vs    248.5</p>
<p>    Turnover	   680.7    vs    604.4</p>
<p>Dividend  3.0 taka per 10-taka share vs 4.0 taka</p>
<p>(Note: The company, 60 pct of which is owned by the British BOC Group Plc, announced the results on Monday. It also provided a one-for-five bonus share. The company said the profit did not keep up with the sales largely as a result of interest charges on the borrowings utilised to finance investments.</p>
</text>
